# Cloudflare Pages — Security Headers + CSP
# Gilt fuer alle Pfade. Pro Projekt anpassen: siehe TODOs in der CSP.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://analytics.z-up.studio https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://analytics.z-up.studio https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

# ── Pro Projekt ergaenzen ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1) Kontaktformular: die Form-Worker-Origin an connect-src UND form-action
#    anhaengen, sonst blockiert die CSP den Formular-POST. Beispiel:
#      connect-src 'self' https://analytics.z-up.studio https://form-worker.xxx.workers.dev
#      form-action 'self' https://form-worker.xxx.workers.dev
#
# 2) Nur wenn TwoClickEmbed genutzt wird, die Embed-Hosts ergaenzen:
#    Google Maps:  frame-src https://www.google.com ;  img-src ... https://maps.gstatic.com
#    YouTube:      frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com
